(footprint Mentor_1278.1004_LightGuide (layer F.Cu) (tedit 0)
  (descr "Mentor 1278.1004 4-way horizontal bargraph light guide, press-in. Order (back->front): back wall -> LED entries (Y=0) -> 3.8mm -> 2x M1.5 lugs (Y=+3.8) -> 4.3mm -> FRONT light-exit face with 4 windows (Y=+8.1, overhangs board edge to panel). Light travels 8.1mm from LED to front face. LEDs = Osram Mini TOPLED M676, 2.54mm pitch. Datasheet ll14-36 / MENTOR_12781004.")
